    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43701" root="&#xA;                        ملك&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلاَكُ الأَمْرِ</span></b> 
                         and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلاَكُهُ</span></b> 
                        <i>That whereby the thing</i>
&amp;c. <i>subsists:</i> (S, KL:) <i>its</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَِوَام</span> [q. v.] <i>by whom,</i>
or <i>by which, it is ruled,</i> or <i>ordered:</i> (K:) <i>its
foundation;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْلُهُ</span>: (KL:) <i>its support;
that upon which it rests:</i> (T, TA:) it may be
rendered <i>the cause,</i> or <i>means, of the subsistence
of the thing;</i> &amp;c.

